• The sentence begins with the subject "he," which is correctly indicated by **part (D).**

• Following the subject, "opened" **(DA)** continues the logical sequence, making it clear what was involved.

• The next part, "the door" comes after "the door," indicated by **(DAC).**

• Ending with "suddenly" **(DACB)** completes the sentence with the manner in which the action occurred.

Therefore, the correct answer is **DACB.**



